# PyPI intent for py310-geo (uv).
# CAVEAT: the PyPI geospatial stack (GDAL especially) needs system GDAL/GEOS/PROJ headers
# and libraries to build; wheels are inconsistent across platforms. In production prefer
# the CONDA environment (or system-installed GDAL). This file is provided for reference.
# conda `gdal`->`GDAL`, `geoalchemy2`->`GeoAlchemy2`.
GDAL
GeoAlchemy2
contextily
fiona
folium
geopandas
mapclassify
pyproj
rasterio
shapely
